message: "If you use Thermo Table Bot in academic, educational, or engineering work, please cite the project using the metadata below."

title: "Thermo Table Bot"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Bijanpour"
    given-names: "Seyed Behnam"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-09

abstract: >-
  Thermo Table Bot is a scientific thermodynamics and psychrometrics
  tool developed by B-Logic. It provides thermodynamic property
  evaluation, automatic region detection, one-dimensional and
  two-dimensional interpolation, saturation and two-phase calculations,
  vapor-quality calculations, refrigerant and engineering-gas property
  calculations, and humid-air psychrometric calculations through a
  Telegram interface.

keywords:
  - thermodynamics
  - thermodynamic properties
  - psychrometrics
  - interpolation
  - engineering education
  - scientific software
  - humid air
  - refrigerants

repository: "https://github.com/BehnamBijanpour/thermo-table-bot"

url: "https://b-logic.me/"
